It might be a discovery about one tiny little sample at one time, maybe, but if it doesn't, if you don't test whether it's general to a lot of contexts and to a lot of people, it's not really a broad discovery. in the sense that we tend to think of in science. So I would be wary of single studies. This is a new study that's told us something that we didn't know before and that nobody ever thought of before. That tends to be something that's getting overhyped. Now, a lot of scams involve promising something that's too good to be true,
它可能是一个关于某一次某一个小样本的发现，也许是这样，但如果你不测试它是否适用于许多背景和许多人，它在科学中我们倾向于认为的意义上并不是一个广泛的发现。所以我对单一研究会持谨慎态度。这是一项告诉我们以前不知道且以前没人想到的事情的新研究。这往往是那些被过度炒作的东西。现在，许多骗局涉及承诺一些好得令人难以置信的事情，

